            naturally act on
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi ℋ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{H}
            and as such form a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+algebra+representation"} Lie algebra representation
            of the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/special+orthogonal+Lie+algebra"} special orthogonal Lie algebra
          %p
            A way to reduce the number of choices in this example of geometric quantization is to proceed by
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantization+via+the+A-model"} quantization via the A-model
            = succeed ")." do
